author=E3N
description=Single Magisk-only FCM candidate. Detects framework capabilities instead of model/OS allowlists, generates local policy and retains Millet/FCM recovery. Requires compatible OEM APIs and ART validation. No APK/LSPosed/Zygisk. Cross-ROM runtime and battery validation pending.
